{
    "about": "The Pajek style vocabulary the Pajek specimen sheets sweep, from Pajek 6.02's manual (section 5.3, pages 89-92: the vertex and line keys of a .net file; Figure 19, page 105: the colors; section 5.2, pages 84-88, and section 4.10, pages 74-77: the Draw window and export options) and the option names Pajek 6.02 writes to its ini file (SAVEINI; the strings in Pajek.exe). pajek.py fails when a value here is on no sheet and not in its NOT_SWEPT list. A value is a literal the file or the ini holds; 'number' and 'text' stand for any number or text, swept at several values.",
    "sources": {
        "manual": "https://mrvar.fdv.uni-lj.si/pajek/pajekman.pdf",
        "ini": "Pajek 6.02 (Pajek64.zip of 2025-12-31): SAVEINI output and the Form8 / Form10 option names in Pajek.exe"
